: "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : \u00cates-vous not\u00e9s sur la participation&nbsp;?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le08ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la notion", "type": "name"}, {"content": "connaissance de base", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'ai d\u00fb revoir mes notions en maths cet apr\u00e8s-midi.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le08ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "crever", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fatiguer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Tu as l'air crev\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le08ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "valoir le coup", "type": "name"}, {"content": "suffisamment int\u00e9ressant  pour se donner la peine de le faire", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'esp\u00e8re que \u00e7a vaut le coup.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le08ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn5le08ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Les sons [\u0251\u0303] et [\u025b\u0303] ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Le son [\u0251\u0303] peut s'\u00e9crire : <span class=\"italic\">an</span>, <span class=\"italic\">am</span>, <span class=\"italic\">en</span> et <span class=\"italic\">em</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ce livre est int\u00e9ressant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "J'entends les vingt chiens du voisin.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Exceptions : <ul><li> \u00c0 la fin d'un mot, si le groupe <span class=\"strong\">en</span> suit une voyelle, alors on prononce [\u025b\u0303] (<span class=\"italic\">lyc\u00e9en</span>). <li>Les groupes <span class=\"strong\">ien</span> et <span class=\"strong\">yen</span> se prononcent [\u025b\u0303] (<span class=\"italic\">chien</span>, <span class=\"italic\">citoyen</span>).<li> Les mots qui se terminent par <span class=\"strong\">men</span> se prononcent [\u025bn] (<span class=\"italic\">barmen</span>) \u00e0 l'exception du mon <span class=\"italic\">examen</span>.<ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Le son [\u025b\u0303] peut s'\u00e9crire : <span class=\"italic\">in</span>, <span class=\"italic\">im</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ain</span>, <span class=\"italic\">aim</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ein</span>, <span class=\"italic\">eim</span>, <span class=\"italic\">en</span>, <span class=\"italic\">un</span>, <span class=\"italic\">yn</span> ou <span class=\"italic\">ym</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Exception : <ul><li>Dans le cas <span class=\"strong\">voyelle + n(n)/m(m) + voyelle</span> on prononce souvent [in] (<span class=\"italic\">copine, m\u00e9decine, magazine, etc.)</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'investissement ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fait de mettre beaucoup de soi-m\u00eame dans une action", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  C'est un investissement sur le long terme.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le08ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la programmation informatique", "type": "name"}, {"content": "ensemble des activit\u00e9s qui permettent de cr\u00e9er des logiciels", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Fais-tu de la programmation informatique ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le08ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "contribuer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "participer ; aider \u00e0 la r\u00e9alisation de quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Nous devons contribuer aux discussions. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le08ob04aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je lis les mots du tableau avec un camarade. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9cris 5 phrases sur le travail ou les \u00e9tudes. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je lis les phrases \u00e0 un camarade.  <br/> <br/>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Lisez les mots du tableau \u00e0 voix haute avec un camarade. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez 5 phrases sur le travail ou les \u00e9tudes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Utilisez 10 mots du tableau. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Cherchez les mots que vous ne connaissez pas dans un dictionnaire. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez les phrases \u00e0 voix haute avec un camarade. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"argent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bien\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"int\u00e9ressant\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"entretien\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"investissement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"train\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"prendre\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quotidien\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"candidat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"impossible\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"alternance\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"int\u00e9rim \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"licence \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"plein\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "L'\u00e2ge de la retraite en France", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Toute personne n\u00e9e en 1955 ou apr\u00e8s, peut partir \u00e0 la retraite d\u00e8s 62 ans. Il est possible de partir \u00e0 la retraite avant cet \u00e2ge : <br/>- si vous avez commenc\u00e9 \u00e0 travailler jeune. <br/>- si vous \u00eates handicap\u00e9(e). <br/>- si vous avez effectu\u00e9 un travail difficile.", "type": "describer"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "frn5le08ob04re2img06.jpg", "audiosrc": "frn5le08ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "", "image": "frn5le08ob04re2img06.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "frn5le08ob04re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : H\u00e9 Pierre. Est-ce que tu as commenc\u00e9 ton nouveau cours de comptabilit\u00e9 ?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Oui. C'est int\u00e9ressant. Je crois que le cours est disponible en ligne et en face-\u00e0-face.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Qu'est-ce que tu veux dire ? La programmation informatique ? Je d\u00e9teste l'informatique&nbsp;!"}, {"time": "14500", "image": "frn5le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Non, nous devons contribuer aux conversations en ligne et travailler en groupe. Je dois utiliser ma Webcam.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Je vois. Est-ce que vous \u00eates not\u00e9s sur la participation ?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Je crois. J'ai d\u00fb revoir mes notions de maths cet apr\u00e8s-midi.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Tu as l'air crev\u00e9. J'esp\u00e8re que \u00e7a vaut le coup. Tu es toujours en train de travailler ou d'\u00e9tudier maintenant. Je ne te vois jamais."}, {"time": "35000", "image": "frn5le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Pierre</span> : \u00c7a me permet de gagner de l'argent et c'est aussi un investissement sur le long terme. Ce sera plus facile pour moi de trouver du travail. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : J'esp\u00e8re que \u00e7a payera.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Il faut savoir viser haut Charlotte. Je veux prendre ma retraite \u00e0 60 ans.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Pierre, il va falloir que tu gagnes bien ta vie !<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Pierre</span> : \u00c7a c'est s\u00fbr !"}]}}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux identifier des sons nasaux.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux comprendre des informations cl\u00e9s dans un court enregistrement audio.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler des \u00e9tudes. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Travaillez et \u00e9tudiez-vous en m\u00eame temps&nbsp;? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Pr\u00e9f\u00e9rez-vous l'enseignement en classe ou \u00e0 distance&nbsp;? Pourquoi&nbsp;? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"cont